                                          Представление "public.clicks_daily_stats"
      Столбец      |           Тип            | Правило сортировки | Допустимость NULL | По умолчанию | Хранилище | Описание 
-------------------+--------------------------+--------------------+-------------------+--------------+-----------+----------
 id                | integer                  |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 date              | date                     |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 campaign_id       | integer                  |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 offer_id          | integer                  |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 landing_id        | integer                  |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 traffic_source_id | integer                  |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 country           | character varying(50)    |                    |                   |              | extended  | 
 clicks            | bigint                   |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 unique_clicks     | bigint                   |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 conversions       | bigint                   |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 leads             | bigint                   |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 sales             | bigint                   |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 cost              | real                     |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 revenue           | real                     |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 profit            | real                     |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 created_at        | timestamp with time zone |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
 updated_at        | timestamp with time zone |                    |                   |              | plain     | 
Определение представления:
 SELECT row_number() OVER ()::integer AS id,
    received_at::date AS date,
    campaign_id,
    offer_id,
    landing_id,
    NULL::integer AS traffic_source_id,
    country,
    count(*) AS clicks,
    count(DISTINCT visitor_id) AS unique_clicks,
    count(*) FILTER (WHERE status = ANY (ARRAY['sale'::conversion_status, 'upsale'::conversion_status, 'lead'::conversion_status])) AS conversions,
    count(*) FILTER (WHERE status = 'lead'::conversion_status) AS leads,
    count(*) FILTER (WHERE status = ANY (ARRAY['sale'::conversion_status, 'upsale'::conversion_status])) AS sales,
    COALESCE(sum(cost), 0::real) AS cost,
    COALESCE(sum(payout), 0::real) AS revenue,
    COALESCE(sum(payout), 0::real) - COALESCE(sum(cost), 0::real) AS profit,
    min(received_at)::timestamp with time zone AS created_at,
    max(received_at)::timestamp with time zone AS updated_at
   FROM conversions_data
  GROUP BY (received_at::date), campaign_id, offer_id, landing_id, country;

